sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Seller Browser
    participant D as Django
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant X as Stripe
    participant W as Webhook Handler
    participant O as Outbox Worker

    S->>D: Submit complete paid draft
    D->>P: Create order + awaiting_payment
    D->>X: Create Checkout Session (idempotency key)
    X-->>D: Session ID/URL
    D-->>S: Redirect to Checkout
    S->>X: Complete payment
    X-->>S: Redirect to success status page
    X->>W: Signed webhook
    W->>P: Store event ID, lock order/listing
    W->>P: Mark paid + pending_moderation + outbox
    W-->>X: 2xx
    O->>P: Claim notification event
    O-->>S: Transactional email
